(#5419)
RESOLUTION - Supporting the City of Cheyenne’s Application for Recreational Trails
Program (RTP) Funds to create the North Cheyenne Community Park Trail System – referred to
Finance Committee (sponsors - Mr. Brown and Mr. Valdez).  Mayor Kaysen referred the item to
Finance Committee.  Reporting for Finance Committee, Mr. Brown advised the item was reviewed
under other items for the agenda at the August 6 Finance Committee meeting and provisions of Title
th
2 of City Code have been met.  Mr. Brown moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Valdez.  Jeff Wiggins,
```

