Appointments of Scott French and Amiee Reese to the Visit Cheyenne Board.  Mr. Spiker
moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Brown.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the
governing body present with the exception of Mayor Kaysen who did not vote (Mayoral appointments).
